"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110133","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110133.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110133.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR adds the `@override` annotation, which is used to enforce that a method overrides a method in a parent class. A method that is declared `@override` but does not actually override anything will be treated as an error.\r\n\r\nMethods that override _without_ explicitly declaring `@override` will trigger an `IMPLICIT_FUNCTION_OVERRIDE` warning.\r\n\r\nTo support this feature, this PR also adds a new feature to `CodeCompletionOption` - support for `additional_edits`, the same way they work in LSP. The `GDScriptLanguage` makes use of this to automatically apply the `@override` annotation when generating a stub for a method override.\r\n\r\nPartially addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12310","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110133/reactions","total_count":29,"+1":17,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":6},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110133/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}